### Key Design Patterns Used

| Pattern | Classes | Purpose |
|---------|---------|---------|
| **Layered Architecture** | Controller → Service → Repository | Separation of concerns |
| **DTO Pattern | *Request/*Response classes | API contract isolation |
| **Repository Pattern** | *Repository interfaces | Data access abstraction |
| **Builder Pattern** | Lombok `@Builder` on DTOs | Fluent object creation |
| **Filter Pattern** | `JwtAuthenticationFilter` | Cross-cutting auth concern |
| **Template Method** | `OrderService.validateTransition()` | State machine enforcement |
| **Idempotency Pattern** | `IdempotencyRecord` + key on Order | Safe retries |
| **Snapshot Pattern** | `OrderItem.itemNameSnapshot`, `OrderItemModifier.nameSnapshot` | Immutable order history |
| **Audit Pattern** | `OrderStatusEvent` | Complete state change history |

### Annotations Used

| Annotation | Applied To | Purpose |
|------------|------------|---------|
| `@RestController` | Controllers | REST endpoint + JSON response |
| `@RequestMapping` | Controllers | Base URL path |
| `@GetMapping/@PostMapping/etc` | Controller methods | HTTP verb + path |
| `@RequestParam` | Method params | Query parameters |
| `@PathVariable` | Method params | URL path variables |
| `@RequestBody` | Method params | JSON request body |
| `@Valid` | Method params | Bean Validation trigger |
| `@AuthenticationPrincipal` | Method params | Current authenticated user |
| `@PreAuthorize` | Controller methods | Role-based access |
| `@Service` | Services | Business logic component |
| `@Transactional` | Service methods | Transaction boundary |
| `@Repository` | Repositories | Data access component |
| `@Entity` | Entities | JPA entity |
| `@Table` | Entities | Table mapping |
| `@Id`, `@GeneratedValue` | Entity fields | Primary key |
| `@Column` | Entity fields | Column mapping |
| `@ManyToOne`, `@OneToMany` | Entity fields | Relationships |
| `@EmbeddedId` | Entity fields | Composite PK |
| `@Enumerated(STRING)` | Entity fields | Enum as string |
| `@PreUpdate` | Entity methods | Auto-set updatedAt |
| `@NotNull`, `@NotBlank`, `@Size`, `@Min`, `@Email` | DTO fields | Validation |